========================================================================
Dual-licensed / multi-licensed transitive dependencies
========================================================================

Many crates.io dependencies declare dual licenses such as
"MIT OR Apache-2.0", "Apache-2.0 OR MIT", or "BSD-2-Clause OR Apache-2.0".
atlas-bot elects the Apache-2.0 (or permissive) option where available.

CI (license-check workflow) fails the build if any package license string
matches GPL or AGPL (case-insensitive).

Run locally:
  ./tools/license-check/check.sh
